abstract: >-
  The public record of hidden timing behavior of RISC-V in-order cores: the stalls, flushes and costs a core has
  that its documentation does not state, understates or states wrongly, each found by comparing the RTL against
  what the documentation promises and each reproduced by a program with its two traces.
